cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PadCraft"
abstract: >-
  A client-side EDA and mechanical CAD generator for RP2040 diode-matrix
  macropads. Generates KiCad board files, Gerbers, STL plates, OpenSCAD, and
  KMK or QMK firmware from a single clamped configuration.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/padcraft"
url: "https://aariv.me/padcraft/"
keywords:
  - macropad
  - keyboard
  - cad
  - eda
  - kicad
  - gerber
  - kmk
  - stl
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
